Package: anndata.claude
Title: Annotated Data Matrices and Their On-Disk Formats
Version: 0.0.0.9030
Authors@R:
    person("Luke", "Zappia", , "luke.zappia@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An R port of Python 'anndata' (reference release 0.13.4) for
    annotated data matrices. The first priority is compatibility with the
    anndata on-disk formats, so that objects read from a file are equal
    whichever language wrote it.
License: BSD_3_clause + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
